  "description": "PRE-ALPHA: This package is under active development and APIs may change significantly. Utility tools for CivitaiSharp including file hashing (BLAKE3, SHA256, SHA512, CRC32), download management with pattern-based file organization, HTML-to-Markdown/PlainText parsing for model descriptions, and file format detection. Builds on CivitaiSharp.Core. CivitaiSharp is an independent open-source project and is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or associated with Civitai.com or Civitai, Inc.",
